null},{"k":"72:8","t":"And we have sought [to reach] the heaven but found it filled with powerful guards and burning flames.","j":29,"h":58,"s":72,"a":8,"sd":null},{"k":"72:9","t":"And we used to sit therein in positions for hearing, but whoever listens now will find a burning flame lying in wait for him.","j":29,"h":58,"s":72,"a":9,"sd":null},{"k":"72:10","t":"And we do not know [therefore] whether evil is intended for those on earth or whether their Lord intends for them a right course.","j":29,"h":58,"s":72,"a":10,"sd":null},{"k":"72:11","t":"And among us are the righteous, and among us are [others] not so; we were [of] divided ways.","j":29,"h":58,"s":72,"a":11,"sd":null},{"k":"72:12","t":"And we have become certain that we will never cause failure to Allāh upon earth, nor can we escape Him by flight.","j":29,"h":58,"s":72,"a":12,"sd":null},{"k":"72:13","t":"And when we heard the guidance [i.e., the Qur’ān], we believed in it. And whoever believes in his Lord will not fear deprivation or burden.","j":29,"h":58,"s":72,"a":13,"sd":null}],"juz":29,"hizb":58,"surahs":[72],"sajdah":false}